# Collaboration Norms

- **The live schema is owned outside this site.** Renames, type changes, and
  data-removing migrations are proposals for the schema owner — not edits to
  apply to their source script unprompted. The Docker test schema
  (`docker/init/01_schema.sql`) can be experimented with freely. Ask the
  schema owner via normal coordination (chat / review / their script); a
  dedicated proposed-SQL handoff file in this repo is not required.
- **Comment-only changes** (trimming a `COLUMN_COMMENT` for display) can be a
  standalone `ALTER TABLE ... MODIFY COLUMN` against a local test container
  without `down -v` and a full reseed.
- Real bugs in pasted upstream SQL (malformed comment, FK to a missing column)
  get fixed when unambiguous. Design choices (FK cascade, physical bounds) get
  flagged, not silently changed.
- **Site-only presentation** (card/table/section layouts, featured rows) does
  not need schema-owner approval. DAQ groupings stay labeled *suggested* until
  confirmed. Do not invent a prefix convention for a table they have not agreed to.
